---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="江南枝茶系列 - 江南枝" description="江南枝茶系列是品牌产品线总称，涵盖启程、唐诗、宋词、孤枝四大分支，甄选武夷山核心产区乌龙茶。">
<section class="pt-32 pb-16 bg-secondary text-center">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
<h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">江南枝茶系列</h1>
<p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg">江南枝甄选江南核心产区好茶，以匠心工艺呈现每一类茶的本真滋味。从启程系列的日常温润，到孤枝系列的极致追求，每一款茶都是对江南山水的不同解读。</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-background">
<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
<div class="" data-reveal="" data-delay="0">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<img src="/images/29939ae3-9081-4d4f-872e-4f029f2b5e1a-aef32c3c.png" alt="江南枝•启程系列" class="w-full h-[300px] lg:h-[350px] object-cover rounded-lg mb-6" loading="lazy">
<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">江南枝•启程系列</h2>
<div class="space-y-3 mb-6 flex-grow">
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">产地：</span>福建·武夷山（生态茶园）</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">风味：</span>香气清雅自然，多表现为清幽的兰花香或淡淡的炒米香，无刺鼻火气；汤色金黄明亮，入口顺滑柔和，苦涩感极低，回甘清甜，有着最纯粹的草木之真味。</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">适合人群：</span>乌龙茶新手、办公一族、追求高性价比的大众消费者。</p>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-md hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors duration-300 text-sm font-medium self-start" href="/contact">咨询此款 <svg viewBox="0 0 448 512" size="12" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z">
</path>
</svg>
</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="" data-reveal="" data-delay="0">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<img src="/images/c1ab4957-750b-4e3b-be44-20a53104cf04-8dde2f8c.webp" alt="江南枝•唐诗系列" class="w-full h-[300px] lg:h-[350px] object-cover rounded-lg mb-6" loading="lazy">
<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">江南枝•唐诗系列</h2>
<div class="space-y-3 mb-6 flex-grow">
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">产地：</span>福建·武夷山（核心产区周边/高山茶园）</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">风味：</span>香气馥郁持久，盖香与落水香协调，呈现浓郁的桂花香、栀子花香或明显的蜜桃果香；汤色橙黄透亮，入口醇厚有&quot;重量感&quot;，回甘迅速，生津明显，喉韵舒畅。</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">适合人群：</span>资深茶友、商务待客、从其他茶类转向乌龙茶寻求口感丰富度的进阶茶客。</p>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-md hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors duration-300 text-sm font-medium self-start" href="/contact">咨询此款 <svg viewBox="0 0 448 512" size="12" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z">
</path>
</svg>
</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="" data-reveal="" data-delay="0">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<img src="/images/d91bef1e-e779-49a9-a51b-1e4b79a630ad-7eef7bc3.png" alt="江南枝•宋词系列" class="w-full h-[300px] lg:h-[350px] object-cover rounded-lg mb-6" loading="lazy">
<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">江南枝•宋词系列</h2>
<div class="space-y-3 mb-6 flex-grow">
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">产地：</span>福建·武夷山（核心山场，如&quot;三坑两涧&quot;）</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">风味：</span>香气沉郁幽远，&quot;水中含香&quot;，呈现独特的乳香、木质香或幽兰香，杯底冷香经久不散；汤色深橙或琥珀色，油润感十足，水路细腻如丝绸，岩韵明显，喉韵深邃，耐泡度极佳。</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">适合人群：</span>鉴赏级玩家、高端礼赠、喜静独饮的行家。</p>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-md hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors duration-300 text-sm font-medium self-start" href="/contact">咨询此款 <svg viewBox="0 0 448 512" size="12" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z">
</path>
</svg>
</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="" data-reveal="" data-delay="0">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<img src="/images/oolong-tea-leaves-in-clay-teapot-on-wooden-tray-87cbe09e.jpg" alt="江南枝•孤枝系列" class="w-full h-[300px] lg:h-[350px] object-cover rounded-lg mb-6" loading="lazy">
<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">江南枝•孤枝系列</h2>
<div class="space-y-3 mb-6 flex-grow">
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">产地：</span>福建·武夷山（稀缺小产区/百年老丛）</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">风味：</span>香气入骨，带有岁月赋予的&quot;丛味&quot;（苔藓味、粽叶香、木质陈香），穿透力强；汤色如琥珀流金，胶质感与&quot;浆感&quot;极强，霸道与温柔并存，饮后口腔有持久的清凉感，每一泡都在变化。</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground">
<span class="text-foreground font-medium">适合人群：</span>顶级藏家、行业领袖、寻找极致稀缺风味的灵魂知音。</p>
</div>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-md hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors duration-300 text-sm font-medium self-start" href="/contact">咨询此款 <svg viewBox="0 0 448 512" size="12" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z">
</path>
</svg>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</SiteLayout>
